From November 14–16, the climbing community gathers once again for three unforgettable days of climbing, learning, and inspiration. The event will feature professional athletes, mountain guides, climbing developers, and climbers from around the world — all coming together in Cornudella de Montsant.

Take part in the climbing clinics led by our professional team of mountain guides and athletes. Last spots available — reserve yours now at siuranaclimbingfestival.com.

The Teatre la Renaixença will once again host film screenings and talks on Friday and Saturday afternoons, with the presence of the protagonists. All screenings and conferences are free and open to the public (no prior registration required, subject to venue capacity).

Learn more at siuranaclimbingfestival.com

