RIDERS ON THE STORM 🎞️

@camp1889outdoor athlete @nicofavresse shares the story of one of the boldest achievements in modern climbing: the free ascent of Riders on the Storm in Patagonia.

Through weeks of wind, ice, and isolation, Nico and his team turned adversity into music, friendship, and creativity.

A film about keeping joy, passion, and freedom even through the toughest storms — in the mountains and in life.

@nicofavresse  will present his film next November 16 in the Teatre La Renaixença, Cornudella de Montsant.

Sponsored by @camp1889outdoor

Siurana is more than just a crag, it’s a birthplace of sport climbing history. Home to legendary routes such as La Rambla 9a+ ( FA @ramonetjp ), Estado Crítico, the first 9a ever onsighted in the world by @alexandermegos and new king lines like Sleeping Lion ( FA @chris_sharma ), Siurana stands as a timeless reference point, a cornerstone of the past, present, and future of sport climbing. This November 15–17, join us at the @siuranaclimbingfestival in celebrating the culture, the legacy, and the community that makes climbing what it is.

